# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A QCSC workflow runs a QPU and an HPC system as one machine.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) runs QCSC workflows on\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) and keeps them traceable, configurable, and resumable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aliran kerja QCSC menjalankan QPU dan sistem HPC sebagai satu mesin.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) menjalankan aliran kerja QCSC pada\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) dan memastikannya boleh dijejaki, boleh dikonfigurasi, dan boleh disambung semula.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates these features with sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) of the N$_2$ molecule. The [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) samples the circuit inside a [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/) job. The\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) eigensolver diagonalizes the sampled\n"
"subspaces in more Slurm jobs. One [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) deployment runs both.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini menunjukkan ciri-ciri ini dengan pepenjuruan kuantum berasaskan sampel (SQD) bagi molekul N$_2$. [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) mensampel litar di dalam tugas [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/). Penyelesai eigen\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) memepenjurukan subruang yang disampel\n"
"dalam lebih banyak tugas Slurm. Satu penempatan [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) menjalankan kedua-duanya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect also runs large QCSC workloads, as in the following projects.\n"
msgstr "QCSC-Prefect juga menjalankan beban kerja QCSC yang besar, seperti dalam projek berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of protein-ligand complexes with more than 12,000 atoms used QCSC-Prefect. It\n"
"sampled quantum-embedding fragments on two 156-qubit IBM Quantum processors, with up to 94\n"
"qubits, and diagonalized the fragment subspaces on the Fugaku, Miyabi-G, and ROQUO\n"
"supercomputers [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu kajian kompleks protein-ligan dengan lebih daripada 12,000 atom menggunakan QCSC-Prefect. Ia\n"
"mensampel serpihan benaman kuantum pada dua pemproses IBM Quantum 156-qubit, dengan sehingga 94\n"
"qubit, dan memepenjurukan subruang serpihan pada superkomputer Fugaku, Miyabi-G, dan ROQUO\n"
"[\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of iron-sulfur clusters ran an extended QCSC-Prefect SQD workflow with 36 orbitals\n"
"(72 qubits) and subspace dimensions up to $3 \\times 10^{10}$ on the Fugaku, Miyabi, and\n"
"ROQUO supercomputers [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu kajian gugusan besi-sulfur menjalankan aliran kerja SQD QCSC-Prefect lanjutan dengan 36 orbital\n"
"(72 qubit) dan dimensi subruang sehingga $3 \\times 10^{10}$ pada superkomputer Fugaku, Miyabi, dan\n"
"ROQUO [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The challenge of QCSC workflows {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"
msgstr "Cabaran aliran kerja QCSC {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SQD workflow is typical of QCSC workloads. QCSC-Prefect answers each of its challenges\n"
"with one feature, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aliran kerja SQD tipikal bagi beban kerja QCSC. QCSC-Prefect menjawab setiap cabarannya\n"
"dengan satu ciri, seperti dalam jadual berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Challenge | QCSC-Prefect feature |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| It spans several resources. A Slurm job holds the QPU, then many Slurm jobs diagonalize subspaces, round after round. | Traceable workflow |\n"
"| It has many parameters at different levels (science, circuit, and cluster), and credentials must stay out of all of them. | Configurable parameters |\n"
"| It is long and can fail anywhere, from a walltime limit, a node failure, or a long QPU queue. Without care, a late failure means sampling on the QPU again. | Resumable execution |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Cabaran | Ciri QCSC-Prefect |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Ia merangkumi beberapa sumber. Satu tugas Slurm memegang QPU, kemudian banyak tugas Slurm memepenjurukan subruang, pusingan demi pusingan. | Aliran kerja boleh dijejaki |\n"
"| Ia mempunyai banyak parameter pada pelbagai aras (sains, litar, dan kluster), dan bukti kelayakan mesti dijauhkan daripada kesemuanya. | Parameter boleh dikonfigurasi |\n"
"| Ia panjang dan boleh gagal di mana-mana, akibat had masa dinding, kegagalan nod, atau giliran QPU yang panjang. Tanpa langkah berjaga-jaga, kegagalan lewat bermakna mensampel pada QPU sekali lagi. | Pelaksanaan boleh disambung semula |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each step of [Qiskit Pattern in QCSC-Prefect step by step](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) ends with a box that shows how QCSC-Prefect traces, configures, and resumes that stage.\n"
msgstr "Setiap langkah [Corak Qiskit dalam QCSC-Prefect langkah demi langkah](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) berakhir dengan kotak yang menunjukkan bagaimana QCSC-Prefect menjejak, mengonfigurasi, dan menyambung semula peringkat itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traceable workflow {#traceable-workflow}"
msgstr "Aliran kerja boleh dijejaki {#traceable-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Prefect *flow* is a Python function made of *tasks*. QCSC-Prefect makes each stage of a\n"
"[Qiskit pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute**, and **Postprocess**) one task. For every run, Prefect Cloud shows the following information:\n"
msgstr "*Flow* Prefect ialah fungsi Python yang terdiri daripada *tugas*. QCSC-Prefect menjadikan setiap peringkat [corak Qiskit](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute**, dan **Postprocess**) satu tugas. Bagi setiap larian, Prefect Cloud menunjukkan maklumat berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The task graph, with an arrow wherever one task passes its result to another.\n"
msgstr "Graf tugas, dengan anak panah di mana-mana satu tugas menghantar hasilnya kepada yang lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The state, inputs, logs, and duration of each task, filterable by the stage tags `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, and `post-process`.\n"
msgstr "Keadaan, input, log, dan tempoh setiap tugas, boleh ditapis mengikut teg peringkat `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, dan `post-process`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The *artifacts*, which are tables and links that tasks publish, such as the source of the\n"
"samples or the energy of each subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"*Artifak*, iaitu jadual dan pautan yang diterbitkan oleh tugas, seperti sumber\n"
"sampel atau tenaga setiap subruang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The workflow host only submits and monitors work. The compute-intensive work runs as Slurm jobs, as in the following image.\n"
msgstr "Hos aliran kerja hanya menghantar dan memantau kerja. Kerja intensif pengiraan dijalankan sebagai tugas Slurm, seperti dalam imej berikut.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
