# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resumable execution {#resumable-execution}"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan boleh disambung semula {#resumable-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prefect stores the results of the first three stages with the flow run. If a later task\n"
"fails, **Retry** on the flow run reuses the stored results and runs only what failed, as in\n"
"the following image.\n"
msgstr ""
"Prefect menyimpan hasil tiga peringkat pertama bersama larian aliran. Jika tugas yang kemudian\n"
"gagal, **Retry** pada larian aliran menggunakan semula hasil yang disimpan dan hanya menjalankan apa yang gagal, seperti dalam\n"
"imej berikut.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![When a run fails and you raise the walltime in the block, Retry repeats only the last stage and reuses the results of the first three stages.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/retry-failed-run.svg 'Retry a failed run')\n"
msgstr "![When a run fails and you raise the walltime in the block, Retry repeats only the last stage and reuses the results of the first three stages.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/retry-failed-run.svg 'Retry a failed run')\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new run can also load the samples of an earlier run instead of sampling, because the Execute\n"
"stage records where its samples are.\n"
msgstr ""
"Larian baharu juga boleh memuatkan sampel larian terdahulu dan bukannya mensampel, kerana peringkat Execute\n"
"merekodkan lokasi sampelnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQD at a glance {#sqd-at-a-glance}"
msgstr "SQD sepintas lalu {#sqd-at-a-glance}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SQD samples bitstrings from a local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) circuit built from coupled cluster singles and doubles (CCSD) amplitudes, fixes the\n"
"bitstrings that noise has corrupted (*configuration recovery*), and diagonalizes the\n"
"Hamiltonian in subspaces spanned by the sampled configurations [\\[3\\]](#references). The\n"
"[SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) explains the algorithm. In QCSC-Prefect, SQD is the\n"
"flow `sqd`, which has the following task graph.\n"
msgstr ""
"SQD mensampel rentetan bit daripada litar local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) yang dibina daripada amplitud coupled cluster singles and doubles (CCSD), membetulkan\n"
"rentetan bit yang rosak akibat hingar (*pemulihan konfigurasi*), dan memepenjurukan\n"
"Hamiltonian dalam subruang yang direntang oleh konfigurasi yang disampel [\\[3\\]](#references). [Tutorial SQD](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) menerangkan algoritma tersebut. Dalam QCSC-Prefect, SQD ialah\n"
"aliran `sqd`, yang mempunyai graf tugas berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Stage | Task | Input from another task |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| Map | `compute_molecular_integrals` | None |\n"
"| Optimize | `get_lucj_params` | Integrals from Map |\n"
"| Execute | `quantum_sampling`, with `build_lucj_circuit` inside it | LUCJ parameters from Optimize |\n"
"| Postprocess | `sqd_loop` | Integrals from Map, and samples from Execute |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Peringkat | Tugas | Input daripada tugas lain |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| Map | `compute_molecular_integrals` | Tiada |\n"
"| Optimize | `get_lucj_params` | Kamiran daripada Map |\n"
"| Execute | `quantum_sampling`, dengan `build_lucj_circuit` di dalamnya | Parameter LUCJ daripada Optimize |\n"
"| Postprocess | `sqd_loop` | Kamiran daripada Map, dan sampel daripada Execute |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When a run reuses samples, `load_qrmi_result` (or `load_runtime_job` for samples from IBM\n"
"Quantum Platform) replaces both `get_lucj_params` and `quantum_sampling`, so the run has no\n"
"Optimize task. In random mode (**Quantum Source** set to `random`), there is no Optimize or\n"
"Execute task, and Map feeds `sqd_loop` directly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila larian menggunakan semula sampel, `load_qrmi_result` (atau `load_runtime_job` untuk sampel daripada IBM\n"
"Quantum Platform) menggantikan kedua-dua `get_lucj_params` dan `quantum_sampling`, jadi larian tidak mempunyai\n"
"tugas Optimize. Dalam mod rawak (**Quantum Source** ditetapkan kepada `random`), tiada tugas Optimize atau\n"
"Execute, dan Map menyuap `sqd_loop` secara langsung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The example is N$_2$ at a bond length of 1.1 $\\AA$ in the 6-31G basis, with the two 1s core\n"
"orbitals frozen. This leaves 16 spatial orbitals with five $\\alpha$ and five $\\beta$ electrons,\n"
"which is a 32-qubit circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contohnya ialah N$_2$ pada panjang ikatan 1.1 $\\AA$ dalam asas 6-31G, dengan dua orbital teras 1s\n"
"dibekukan. Ini meninggalkan 16 orbital ruang dengan lima elektron $\\alpha$ dan lima elektron $\\beta$,\n"
"iaitu litar 32-qubit.\n"

