# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following steps compute the four stages in this notebook with [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime, and [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), without Prefect. See the [SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) for the details of each computation.\n"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah berikut mengira empat peringkat dalam notebook ini dengan [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime, dan [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), tanpa Prefect. Lihat [tutorial SQD](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) untuk butiran setiap pengiraan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Map stage, the task `compute_molecular_integrals` in the workflow, turns the molecule into the inputs of all later stages. Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF) gives the molecular orbitals, and the active-space integrals leave out the two frozen 1s cores. CCSD gives the $t_2$ amplitudes of the ansatz, and its density matrix gives the orbital occupancies that start configuration recovery. CCSD iterates `CCSD_MAXITER` times, each time from the previous amplitudes, so the result does not depend on the DIIS history of the first iteration. This notebook uses 4 iterations, and the workflow uses 10.\n"
msgstr "Peringkat Map, iaitu task `compute_molecular_integrals` dalam aliran kerja, menukar molekul kepada input bagi semua peringkat seterusnya. Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF) memberikan orbital molekul, dan kamiran ruang aktif mengecualikan dua teras 1s yang dibekukan. CCSD memberikan amplitud $t_2$ bagi ansatz, dan matriks ketumpatannya memberikan okupansi orbital yang memulakan pemulihan konfigurasi. CCSD berulang sebanyak `CCSD_MAXITER` kali, setiap kali daripada amplitud sebelumnya, jadi hasilnya tidak bergantung pada sejarah DIIS lelaran pertama. Notebook ini menggunakan 4 lelaran, dan aliran kerja menggunakan 10.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"How QCSC-Prefect manages this step\">\n"
