# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Optimize stage, the task `get_lucj_params` in the workflow, fits the ansatz to the QPU before any circuit exists. ffsim builds the LUCJ operator from $t_2$ with only the interactions that a heavy-hex lattice runs without SWAP gates. These are the same-spin pairs of neighboring orbitals and the opposite-spin pairs on every fourth orbital, at most five on a heavy-hex (Heron) processor. ffsim then compresses the operator (`optimize=True`, on by default in the workflow) so that one layer reproduces $t_2$ more closely.\n"
msgstr "Peringkat Optimize, iaitu task `get_lucj_params` dalam aliran kerja, menyesuaikan ansatz dengan QPU sebelum sebarang litar wujud. ffsim membina operator LUCJ daripada $t_2$ dengan hanya interaksi yang dijalankan oleh kekisi heavy-hex tanpa gate SWAP. Ini ialah pasangan spin sama bagi orbital berjiran dan pasangan spin bertentangan pada setiap orbital keempat, paling banyak lima pada pemproses heavy-hex (Heron). Kemudian ffsim memampatkan operator (`optimize=True`, dihidupkan secara lalai dalam aliran kerja) supaya satu lapisan menghasilkan semula $t_2$ dengan lebih tepat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace:** The task `get_lucj_params` has the tag `optimize`. Its result carries everything that the circuit needs, so one arrow leads from it to `quantum_sampling`.\n"
msgstr "**Jejak:** Task `get_lucj_params` mempunyai tag `optimize`. Hasilnya membawa semua yang diperlukan oleh litar, jadi satu anak panah menuju daripadanya ke `quantum_sampling`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Configure:** The **Circuit** group of the run form sets the LUCJ layers, the compression and its iteration limit, and the **QPU Topology** (`heavy-hex` or `square`), which sets the interaction pairs. The `sqd-advanced-settings` block holds reset mitigation and the transpiler settings (the optimization level and the SABRE layout search) that the Execute stage uses.\n"
msgstr "**Konfigurasi:** Kumpulan **Circuit** pada borang run menetapkan lapisan LUCJ, pemampatan dan had lelarannya, serta **QPU Topology** (`heavy-hex` atau `square`), yang menentukan pasangan interaksi. Block `sqd-advanced-settings` menyimpan reset mitigation dan tetapan transpiler (tahap pengoptimuman dan carian susun atur SABRE) yang digunakan oleh peringkat Execute.\n"

