# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Execute stage, the task `quantum_sampling` in the workflow, builds the circuit (Hartree-Fock state, LUCJ operator, and measurement),\n"
"transpiles it for the QPU, and samples it. The ffsim `PRE_INIT` passes run first in the\n"
"transpiler and turn the ffsim gates into efficient native-gate sequences. This notebook\n"
"samples with Qiskit Runtime on `ibm_fez`. Replace `ibm_fez` with a backend that your instance\n"
"can use. The workflow samples with QRMI instead, in a Slurm job that holds the QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Peringkat Execute, iaitu task `quantum_sampling` dalam aliran kerja, membina litar (keadaan Hartree-Fock, operator LUCJ, dan pengukuran),\n"
"mentranspile-nya untuk QPU, dan mensampelnya. Pass `PRE_INIT` ffsim berjalan dahulu dalam\n"
"transpiler dan menukar gate ffsim kepada jujukan gate natif yang cekap. Notebook ini\n"
"mensampel dengan Qiskit Runtime pada `ibm_fez`. Gantikan `ibm_fez` dengan backend yang boleh digunakan oleh instance\n"
"anda. Aliran kerja pula mensampel dengan QRMI, dalam job Slurm yang memegang QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a baseline, draw the same number of uniform random bitstrings, as the workflow does with\n"
"**Quantum Source** set to `random`. The following cell also prints the fraction of each sample\n"
"set with the correct electron numbers. Step 4 compares SQD on the two sample sets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai garis dasar, lukis bilangan rentetan bit rawak seragam yang sama, seperti yang dilakukan aliran kerja dengan\n"
"**Quantum Source** ditetapkan kepada `random`. Sel berikut juga mencetak pecahan setiap set sampel\n"
"dengan bilangan elektron yang betul. Langkah 4 membandingkan SQD pada kedua-dua set sampel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trace:** The task `quantum_sampling` has the tag `execute`, and the task\n"
"`build_lucj_circuit` runs inside it. The workflow host prepares the circuit and submits a\n"
"Slurm job that requests the QPU. On the compute node, the SPANK plugin opens the QPU session,\n"
"and the QRMI worker transpiles and samples the circuit.\n"
"The task logs show the walltime of the Slurm job, the two-qubit depth of the transpiled\n"
"circuit, and, when sampling completes, the IBM Quantum job ID and the QPU execution time.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jejak:** Task `quantum_sampling` mempunyai tag `execute`, dan task\n"
"`build_lucj_circuit` berjalan di dalamnya. Hos aliran kerja menyediakan litar dan menghantar\n"
"job Slurm yang meminta QPU. Pada nod pengiraan, plugin SPANK membuka sesi QPU,\n"
"dan pekerja QRMI mentranspile serta mensampel litar.\n"
"Log task menunjukkan walltime job Slurm, kedalaman dua-qubit bagi\n"
"litar yang ditranspile, dan, apabila pensampelan selesai, ID job IBM Quantum serta masa pelaksanaan QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Configure:** The **Sampling** group of the run form sets the shots and the source of the\n"
"samples, which is the `qrmi-runtime` block, the job of an earlier run, or random bitstrings.\n"
"The QRMI blocks hold where and how the sampler job runs, and the credentials stay on the\n"
"cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Konfigurasi:** Kumpulan **Sampling** pada borang run menetapkan shot dan sumber\n"
"sampel, iaitu block `qrmi-runtime`, job daripada run terdahulu, atau rentetan bit rawak.\n"
"Block QRMI menyimpan tempat dan cara job sampler berjalan, dan kelayakan kekal pada\n"
"kluster.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resume:** The samples are persisted (`compressed/pickle`), so **Retry** submits no new QPU\n"
"job. The `sqd-sampling-source` artifact records where the samples are, so a new run can reuse\n"
"them, as in [Optional: resume and reuse the workflow](#optional-resume-and-reuse-the-workflow).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sambung semula:** Sampel disimpan secara kekal (`compressed/pickle`), jadi **Retry** tidak menghantar job\n"
"QPU baharu. Artifact `sqd-sampling-source` merekodkan lokasi sampel, jadi run baharu boleh menggunakannya\n"
"semula, seperti dalam [Pilihan: sambung semula dan guna semula aliran kerja](#optional-resume-and-reuse-the-workflow).\n"

