msgstr "![The quantum_sampling task in the flow run graph, with the nested build_lucj_circuit task and the task of the QRMI Slurm job. The task logs report the Slurm job, the IBM Quantum job, the shots, and the QPU execution time.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/step-execute.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Why Execute builds and transpiles the circuit\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Sebab Execute membina dan mentranspile litar\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker transpiles the circuit on the compute node against the current Target of the\n"
"QPU, so the QRMI Runtime owns transpilation. This split prepares for fault-tolerant QCSC\n"
"systems, where the transpilation of quantum low-density parity-check (LDPC) error-correction\n"
"circuits is a heavy workload. The workflow caches the circuit parameters, not the circuits.\n"
"Map and Optimize design the circuit. Map computes the CCSD amplitudes, and Optimize compresses\n"
"the LUCJ operator with `ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes(optimize=True)`, which can\n"
"take longer than the transpilation for a current QPU. `build_lucj_circuit` and the transpiler\n"
"only encode these parameters into an ISA circuit. This split differs from the conventional\n"
"Qiskit pattern, and it suggests what a Qiskit pattern can look like in a QCSC system.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pekerja QRMI mentranspile litar pada nod pengiraan berdasarkan Target semasa\n"
"QPU, jadi QRMI Runtime memiliki transpilation. Pembahagian ini bersedia untuk sistem QCSC\n"
"toleran-kesalahan, yang transpilation litar pembetulan ralat quantum low-density parity-check (LDPC)\n"
"ialah beban kerja yang berat. Aliran kerja menyimpan cache parameter litar, bukan litar.\n"
"Map dan Optimize mereka bentuk litar. Map mengira amplitud CCSD, dan Optimize memampatkan\n"
"operator LUCJ dengan `ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes(optimize=True)`, yang boleh\n"
"mengambil masa lebih lama daripada transpilation untuk QPU semasa. `build_lucj_circuit` dan transpiler\n"
"hanya mengekod parameter ini ke dalam litar ISA. Pembahagian ini berbeza daripada\n"
"corak Qiskit konvensional, dan ia mencadangkan rupa corak Qiskit dalam sistem QCSC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Postprocess and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-postprocess-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pasca-proses dan pulangkan hasil dalam format klasik yang dikehendaki {#step-4-postprocess-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Postprocess stage, the task `sqd_loop` in the workflow, runs self-consistent configuration recovery. Each round corrects the\n"
"sampled bitstrings with the current orbital occupancies, diagonalizes the Hamiltonian in\n"
"several batches of configurations, and updates the occupancies from the best result. The\n"
"following cell runs `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian` on both sample sets with the same\n"
"settings. The subspace dimension is the workflow's 1,000,000 determinants (1,000 strings per\n"
"spin). The notebook uses two batches per round and ten rounds, and the workflow uses four\n"
"batches and five rounds. As in the workflow, Fulqrum diagonalizes each subspace.\n"
"`sci_solver_from_integrals` builds the Fulqrum Hamiltonian one time and returns the\n"
"`sci_solver` that the function calls for each batch. A `TrimPolicy`, as in the\n"
"[SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization), merges the heaviest\n"
"strings of the batches into one subspace and diagonalizes it. Of the strings above\n"
"`carryover_threshold`, the policy keeps the heaviest half (`carryover_ratio=0.5`) for the next\n"
"round, like the workflow's **Carryover Fraction**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Peringkat Postprocess, iaitu task `sqd_loop` dalam aliran kerja, menjalankan pemulihan konfigurasi swa-konsisten. Setiap pusingan membetulkan\n"
"rentetan bit yang disampel dengan okupansi orbital semasa, mendiagonalkan Hamiltonian dalam\n"
"beberapa kelompok konfigurasi, dan mengemas kini okupansi daripada hasil terbaik. Sel\n"
"berikut menjalankan `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian` pada kedua-dua set sampel dengan tetapan\n"
"yang sama. Dimensi subruang ialah 1,000,000 determinan aliran kerja (1,000 rentetan bagi setiap\n"
"spin). Notebook menggunakan dua kelompok setiap pusingan dan sepuluh pusingan, dan aliran kerja menggunakan empat\n"
"kelompok dan lima pusingan. Seperti dalam aliran kerja, Fulqrum mendiagonalkan setiap subruang.\n"
"`sci_solver_from_integrals` membina Hamiltonian Fulqrum sekali dan memulangkan\n"
"`sci_solver` yang dipanggil oleh fungsi untuk setiap kelompok. `TrimPolicy`, seperti dalam\n"
"[tutorial SQD](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization), menggabungkan rentetan\n"
"terberat bagi kelompok ke dalam satu subruang dan mendiagonalkannya. Daripada rentetan di atas\n"
"`carryover_threshold`, polisi mengekalkan separuh yang terberat (`carryover_ratio=0.5`) untuk pusingan\n"
"seterusnya, seperti **Carryover Fraction** aliran kerja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The plot compares both sample sets, round by round, with the full configuration interaction (FCI) energy of this active space, $-109.10336546$ Ha, which PySCF computes in about a minute (`cas.run()` on the preceding `CASCI` object). The dashed line is chemical accuracy, 1.6 mHa.\n"
msgstr "Plot membandingkan kedua-dua set sampel, pusingan demi pusingan, dengan tenaga full configuration interaction (FCI) bagi ruang aktif ini, $-109.10336546$ Ha, yang dikira PySCF dalam kira-kira seminit (`cas.run()` pada objek `CASCI` sebelumnya). Garis putus-putus ialah ketepatan kimia, 1.6 mHa.\n"

