# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trace:** The task `sqd_loop` has the tag `post-process`. It receives the samples and\n"
"the integrals, so the graph shows two arrows into it. Each batch is one `FulqrumSolverJob`\n"
"call, a `solve_eigenstate` task that submits one Slurm job running Fulqrum. The batches of a\n"
"round run concurrently on the compute nodes. The `sqd-configuration-recovery` artifact lists\n"
"the energy and dimension of every subspace in every round.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jejak:** Task `sqd_loop` mempunyai tag `post-process`. Ia menerima sampel dan\n"
"kamiran, jadi graf menunjukkan dua anak panah masuk ke dalamnya. Setiap kelompok ialah satu panggilan\n"
"`FulqrumSolverJob`, iaitu task `solve_eigenstate` yang menghantar satu job Slurm yang menjalankan Fulqrum. Kelompok bagi satu\n"
"pusingan berjalan serentak pada nod pengiraan. Artifact `sqd-configuration-recovery` menyenaraikan\n"
"tenaga dan dimensi setiap subruang dalam setiap pusingan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Configure:** The **SQD** group of the run form sets the subspace dimension, the number of\n"
"batches, and the number of rounds. **Solver Block Override** (`solver_block_ref`) in the\n"
"run form replaces the **Solver Block** of `sqd-advanced-settings` for one run, for example with\n"
"a DICE or SBD block. The eigensolver (PRIMME), threads, and walltime are in the\n"
"`sqd-fulqrum-solver` block and its execution profile. The flow loads the solver block before\n"
"any stage, so a wrong block name fails the run before it uses the QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Konfigurasi:** Kumpulan **SQD** pada borang run menetapkan dimensi subruang, bilangan\n"
"kelompok, dan bilangan pusingan. **Solver Block Override** (`solver_block_ref`) pada\n"
"borang run menggantikan **Solver Block** bagi `sqd-advanced-settings` untuk satu run, contohnya dengan\n"
"block DICE atau SBD. Pemecah eigen (PRIMME), thread, dan walltime terdapat dalam\n"
"block `sqd-fulqrum-solver` dan profil pelaksanaannya. Flow memuatkan block solver sebelum\n"
"sebarang peringkat, jadi nama block yang salah menggagalkan run sebelum ia menggunakan QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resume:** `sqd_loop` is not cached, but it saves a checkpoint after every round, in\n"
"`sqd_checkpoints/<flow run id>/ckpt_t00_w0.npz` under the solver's `work_dir`. The checkpoint\n"
"holds the occupancies that seed the next round and the best energy so far. On **Retry**,\n"
"`sqd_loop` continues after the last completed round, with the current blocks.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sambung semula:** `sqd_loop` tidak di-cache, tetapi ia menyimpan checkpoint selepas setiap pusingan, dalam\n"
"`sqd_checkpoints/<flow run id>/ckpt_t00_w0.npz` di bawah `work_dir` solver. Checkpoint\n"
"menyimpan okupansi yang menjadi benih pusingan seterusnya dan tenaga terbaik setakat ini. Pada **Retry**,\n"
"`sqd_loop` menyambung selepas pusingan terakhir yang selesai, dengan block semasa.\n"

