msgid "In Prefect Cloud, go to **Deployments**, select `sqd`, then select **Run** -> **Custom run**. Set **FCIDump File**, the only field without a default, as in the following table. The other rows show the defaults. The form marks the three SQD fields as required, although they have defaults. Select **Submit**.\n"
msgstr "Dalam Prefect Cloud, pergi ke **Deployments**, pilih `sqd`, kemudian pilih **Run** -> **Custom run**. Tetapkan **FCIDump File**, satu-satunya medan tanpa nilai lalai, seperti dalam jadual berikut. Baris lain menunjukkan nilai lalai. Borang menandakan tiga medan SQD sebagai wajib, walaupun ia mempunyai nilai lalai. Pilih **Submit**.\n"

