#, no-wrap
msgid "A path relative to the `~/qcsc-prefect` checkout also works. `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/default_params/n2.json` holds the same parameters for scripted runs. **Checkpoint Recovery** adds a folder of less than 1 MB per run under `work_dir/sqd_checkpoints/`, even for 1000 orbitals, and nothing removes it.\n"
