# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a first run without the QPU, set **Quantum Source** to `random`, which runs the solver jobs on uniform random bitstrings. To sample through IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) from the workflow host instead of a Slurm job, save a `QrmiRuntimeBlock` with `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (the `[runtime]` table of `sqd_blocks.toml`, in place of `[qrmi]`), and name it in **QRMI Runtime Block**. This block reads the API key from the `qrmi_config.json` file of the workflow host.\n"
msgstr "Untuk run pertama tanpa QPU, tetapkan **Quantum Source** kepada `random`, yang menjalankan job solver pada rentetan bit rawak seragam. Untuk mensampel melalui IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) daripada hos aliran kerja dan bukannya job Slurm, simpan `QrmiRuntimeBlock` dengan `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (jadual `[runtime]` dalam `sqd_blocks.toml`, sebagai ganti `[qrmi]`), dan namakannya dalam **QRMI Runtime Block**. Block ini membaca kunci API daripada fail `qrmi_config.json` pada hos aliran kerja.\n"

