# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The flow run page shows the task graph with the state of each task, the logs, and, on the **Artifacts** tab, the five artifacts in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Halaman flow run menunjukkan graf task dengan keadaan setiap task, log, dan, pada tab **Artifacts**, lima artifact dalam jadual berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Artifact | Published by | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `sqd-sampling-source` | Execute | Where the samples are (QRMI work directory, or IBM Quantum job ID for IQP), resource, and shots |\n"
"| `qrmi-slurm-job` | Execute | The ID, state, and work directory of the QRMI sampler's Slurm job |\n"
"| `sqd-configuration-recovery` | Postprocess | Energy and dimension of every subspace in every round |\n"
"| `sqd-checkpoint` | Postprocess | Checkpoint path, completed rounds, and best energy, when **Checkpoint Recovery** is on |\n"
"| `slurm-sqd-fulqrum-metrics` | Postprocess | The ID, state, exit code, elapsed time, and nodes of the latest solver job |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Artifact | Diterbitkan oleh | Kandungan |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `sqd-sampling-source` | Execute | Lokasi sampel (direktori kerja QRMI, atau ID job IBM Quantum untuk IQP), sumber, dan shot |\n"
"| `qrmi-slurm-job` | Execute | ID, keadaan, dan direktori kerja job Slurm bagi sampler QRMI |\n"
"| `sqd-configuration-recovery` | Postprocess | Tenaga dan dimensi setiap subruang dalam setiap pusingan |\n"
"| `sqd-checkpoint` | Postprocess | Laluan checkpoint, pusingan yang selesai, dan tenaga terbaik, apabila **Checkpoint Recovery** dihidupkan |\n"
"| `slurm-sqd-fulqrum-metrics` | Postprocess | ID, keadaan, kod keluar, masa berlalu, dan nod job solver terkini |\n"

