msgstr "![The Artifacts tab of a completed run lists five artifacts, with the sqd-configuration-recovery table open.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/artifacts.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The energy that the flow reports is the lowest energy in the `sqd-configuration-recovery` table. Each solver job leaves a `job_<timestamp>_<id>` directory under `work_dir`. The directory holds the rendered Slurm script, `input.npz`, `solver.json`, and the Slurm output. It also holds `output.npz` and `result.json` on success, or `error.json` on failure. Use `sacct` to see the jobs of the run.\n"
msgstr "Tenaga yang dilaporkan oleh flow ialah tenaga terendah dalam jadual `sqd-configuration-recovery`. Setiap job solver meninggalkan direktori `job_<timestamp>_<id>` di bawah `work_dir`. Direktori itu menyimpan skrip Slurm yang dirender, `input.npz`, `solver.json`, dan output Slurm. Ia juga menyimpan `output.npz` dan `result.json` jika berjaya, atau `error.json` jika gagal. Gunakan `sacct` untuk melihat job bagi run tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: resume and reuse the workflow {#optional-resume-and-reuse-the-workflow}"
msgstr "Pilihan: sambung semula dan guna semula aliran kerja {#optional-resume-and-reuse-the-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retry a failed run, and reuse its samples {#retry-a-failed-run-and-reuse-its-samples}"
msgstr "Cuba semula run yang gagal, dan guna semula sampelnya {#retry-a-failed-run-and-reuse-its-samples}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Retry:** Suppose that, in a run with **Max Iteration** set to `10`, a solver job hits its walltime in round 5 and `sqd_loop` fails. Raise the walltime in the `exec-sqd-fulqrum-slurm` block under **Blocks**, then select **Retry** on the failed flow run. The retried run loads the stored results of the first three stages and submits no QPU job. It runs only `sqd_loop` again, with the new walltime, and starts at round 5 from the checkpoint of round 4. Its log shows `[ckpt] RESUME from …: completed 4 step(s)`, then `SQD iteration 5/10`, as in the following image.\n"
msgstr "**Retry:** Andaikan bahawa, dalam run dengan **Max Iteration** ditetapkan kepada `10`, job solver mencapai walltime pada pusingan 5 dan `sqd_loop` gagal. Naikkan walltime dalam block `exec-sqd-fulqrum-slurm` di bawah **Blocks**, kemudian pilih **Retry** pada flow run yang gagal. Run yang dicuba semula memuatkan hasil tersimpan bagi tiga peringkat pertama dan tidak menghantar job QPU. Ia hanya menjalankan `sqd_loop` sekali lagi, dengan walltime baharu, dan bermula pada pusingan 5 daripada checkpoint pusingan 4. Lognya menunjukkan `[ckpt] RESUME from …: completed 4 step(s)`, kemudian `SQD iteration 5/10`, seperti dalam imej berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Reuse:** A new run computes everything again unless you point it to earlier samples. To try another subspace dimension with the same samples, start a custom run with the same parameters, set **Load from QRMI Job Directory** (`qrmi_result_dir`) to the work directory in the `sqd-sampling-source` artifact of the first run, and change **Subspace Dimension**. The new run replaces `get_lucj_params` and `quantum_sampling` with `load_qrmi_result`, which reads the samples and submits nothing to the QPU. **Reset Mitigation** in `sqd-advanced-settings` must match the first run, because the reload applies it. For samples taken through IQP, set **Load from Qiskit Runtime Job ID** (`qiskit_runtime_job_id`) instead, and the stage is `load_runtime_job`. It reads the job with the credentials of the prefect-qiskit `QuantumRuntime` block named in **Quantum Runtime Block (reload)** (`ibm-runner` by default). Create that block one time with `prefect block create quantum-runtime`.\n"
msgstr "**Reuse:** Run baharu mengira semuanya semula melainkan anda menunjukkannya kepada sampel terdahulu. Untuk mencuba dimensi subruang lain dengan sampel yang sama, mulakan custom run dengan parameter yang sama, tetapkan **Load from QRMI Job Directory** (`qrmi_result_dir`) kepada direktori kerja dalam artifact `sqd-sampling-source` bagi run pertama, dan ubah **Subspace Dimension**. Run baharu menggantikan `get_lucj_params` dan `quantum_sampling` dengan `load_qrmi_result`, yang membaca sampel dan tidak menghantar apa-apa kepada QPU. **Reset Mitigation** dalam `sqd-advanced-settings` mesti sepadan dengan run pertama, kerana pemuatan semula menerapkannya. Untuk sampel yang diambil melalui IQP, tetapkan **Load from Qiskit Runtime Job ID** (`qiskit_runtime_job_id`) sebagai ganti, dan peringkatnya ialah `load_runtime_job`. Ia membaca job dengan kelayakan block `QuantumRuntime` prefect-qiskit yang dinamakan dalam **Quantum Runtime Block (reload)** (`ibm-runner` secara lalai). Cipta block itu sekali dengan `prefect block create quantum-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Continue a recovery with more rounds:** Start a custom run with the same parameters, set **Resume from Checkpoint** (`resume_checkpoint`) to the path in the `sqd-checkpoint` artifact of the first run, and raise **Max Iteration**. The new run continues after the completed rounds, from the stored occupancies and best energy. For example, a checkpoint with 32 of 100 rounds done and **Max Iteration** set to `200` continues at round 33/200. The new run reads that checkpoint and writes its own, and the following rules apply.\n"
msgstr "**Sambung pemulihan dengan lebih banyak pusingan:** Mulakan custom run dengan parameter yang sama, tetapkan **Resume from Checkpoint** (`resume_checkpoint`) kepada laluan dalam artifact `sqd-checkpoint` bagi run pertama, dan naikkan **Max Iteration**. Run baharu menyambung selepas pusingan yang telah selesai, daripada okupansi dan tenaga terbaik yang disimpan. Contohnya, checkpoint dengan 32 daripada 100 pusingan selesai dan **Max Iteration** ditetapkan kepada `200` menyambung pada pusingan 33/200. Run baharu membaca checkpoint itu dan menulis checkpointnya sendiri, dan peraturan berikut terpakai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The samples, the molecule, **Subspace Dimension**, **Batch Number**, and the solver type (the `fulqrum_solver_job` part of the solver block) must match the first run, so reuse its samples as in **Reuse**.\n"
msgstr "Sampel, molekul, **Subspace Dimension**, **Batch Number**, dan jenis solver (bahagian `fulqrum_solver_job` pada block solver) mesti sepadan dengan run pertama, jadi guna semula sampelnya seperti dalam **Reuse**.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The name and the job settings of the solver block, such as its walltime, can change.\n"
msgstr "Nama dan tetapan job bagi block solver, seperti walltimenya, boleh diubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a setting that must match differs, the run fails before any solver job and names the difference.\n"
msgstr "Jika tetapan yang mesti sepadan berbeza, run gagal sebelum sebarang job solver dan menamakan perbezaan tersebut.\n"

